      "sidechain_inside_arc_notional_list_value_usd": 0,
      "session_total_notional_list_value_usd": 0.5355,
      "notes": "THE shape the rule exists for, and the only one in this fixture where a multi-turn anchor run is followed by another anchor. Run 0 is (start=0, tag_end=2), run 1 starts at 4, so the boundary must be next_run.start-1 = 3. Using next_run.tag_end (5) would claim turns 4 and 5 twice. Every other session's non-final runs have length 1, where start == tag_end and the two are indistinguishable -- real runs are median 15 turns, so this is the normal shape, not an edge case."
    },
