      "session_total_notional_list_value_usd": 0.2295,
      "notes": "File order is O2, O0, O1; timestamp order is O0, O1, O2. After sorting, the anchor is at index 0 and the untagged turn last, so the arc is [0..2]. Read in file order the anchor would land at index 1 and turn 0 would fall into the unattributable remainder. 'The next anchor' is only meaningful in time."
    }
